config BR2_PACKAGE_MORSE_DRIVER
	bool "morse-driver (MM6108 HaLow)"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Morse Micro MM6108 HaLow driver.  Linux 7.3 only carries the
	  newer MM8108 driver, so the MM6108 needs this out-of-tree module.

	  https://github.com/MorseMicro/morse_driver

comment "morse-driver needs a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
